# Real bank statements used to develop the statement importer. These are
# actual personal financial documents — account numbers, balances, every
# transaction. This repository is PUBLIC. Never commit them; keep redacted
# fixtures under a tests/ directory instead if the parser needs checked-in
# examples.
samples/
*.pdf

# agent worktrees — created inside the repo by the harness's worktree tool.
# Not ignored by default, so `git add -A` would otherwise stage an entire
# second checkout. Scoped to worktrees/ rather than all of .claude/ so a
# project-level .claude/settings.json stays committable.
.claude/worktrees/

